  "title": {
   "en": "Kodomo ni Natsukaretara Kaseifu ni Narimashita. - Are? Kishi-sama ni mo Dekiaisareteru you desu?!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "子供に懐かれたら家政婦になりました。 あれ？騎士様にも溺愛されてるようです!?"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Child and the Knight Are Both in Love With Me"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "17-year-old Lina lives in the kingdom of Wamonal. She’s a positive girl searching for a job to become independent. But one day, she suddenly regains memories of her past life as a preschool teacher. By chance, she grows close to a young girl named Alice, turning her life upside down! Because of Alice’s attachment to her, her guardian—the knight Lucas—asks Lina to work as a live-in housekeeper with them…?!\n\n---\n**Original Web Novel:** [Kakuyomu](https://kakuyomu.jp/works/16816452220749935215), [Syosetu](https://ncode.syosetu.com/n0662ha/)"
  },
